--
--   Description
----------------
--  Simple test to exercise different comma alignment of PCS RX CAL block.
--
-- Detailed Test Description
----------------------------
--  Start with testbench bit slip set to 0.
--  Wait for link up interrupt and check status
--  Increase bit slip of testbench, this should cause PCS to lose sync.
--  Wait for link down interrupt and check status
--  CAL should realign under control of RX sync state machine, so don't need to do anything...
--  Wait for link up interrupt and check status
--  Repeat with increasing bit slip values.
--
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

pinsd(20) keep_idle_i1  1 -- Use /I1/ group for better coverage
pinsd(40) tb_rx_bit_slip  00000000  -- start with no bit slip
pinsc(50) loopback 0 half_duplex 1  extint 0 speed 0 --  check reset state

